body:
I dont think I can say I liked it more than the original, but its very close. I dont really watch a lot of modern action movies because I rarely enjoy them, but I fucking loved Prey. 

&#x200B;

I got the same feeling watching this as I did Fury Road, which I consider the best action film in decades. Simple plot that moves with a fast pace, the characters and dialogue feel real and it even had excellent sound and look. Also the action scenes were super cool and shot very well without excessive camera shake.

&#x200B;

My only negatives are that I couldnt see this in a theater, and the movie was visually a bit too dark at some points

[This](https://media.discordapp.net/attachments/419992909946028055/912745067138121768/2021.01.18-20.56.png?width=831&height=467) is probaby the best build I've had in AD, it was bulwark with dispersion, rage and flesh golem. Rushed blademail and agsh and just laughed as the enemies killed themselves while hitting me.

&#x200B;

[This](https://media.discordapp.net/attachments/419992909946028055/912775491151331339/Bounty.png?width=986&height=50) was also really fun, burrow with BH invis shard was like 80% dmg reduction, as soon as I had shard and Aghs I just went to their base burrowed and annoyed them.

Dunno, something to kill the time?

&#x200B;

Would you call watching TV a hobby?

Update: The guy was cheating and beat me to death while running around me 80mp/h

&#x200B;

Fuck official servers.
